<mt:Ignore>
  Environment configuration module.
  Include this at the top of every page template.

  env_has_cf:
    0 = CustomFields plugin NOT available (local free MT — safe fallback, no filtering)
    1 = CustomFields plugin available (MT Cloud — production behavior)

  LOCAL DEV (this file):
    env_has_cf = 0
    → All entries visible (no display_target filter)
    → Thumbnails show placeholder
    → Ranking shows most-recent entries as fallback

  CLOUD DEPLOYMENT:
    Change env_has_cf to 1
    → Full CF-based filtering active
    → Also create module "azcom-article-cf-entry" in MT Admin (Website level)
</mt:Ignore>
<mt:SetVar name="env_has_cf" value="0" global="1">
